From: gaia <build@heygaia.io>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 07:24:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(net): the subresource cache and request sharing live
 in their own loader

The plain client's response cache and in-flight request coalescing move,
unchanged, into resource_loader.rs, behind a load() that takes the uncached
fetch and the observer replay as closures, so the stealth client can use
the same loader.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tm2SNEJ42hMPiZ6cFb8Vih
